quently requests  a pistol from rick to end things  on her own terms tyrese is the group's  resident gentle giant before his tragic  and untimely death though he suffers  numerous tragedies throughout his tenure  it never once dampens his ability to  save the people around him  viewers got an explanation for tyrese's  extremely empathetic and emotional state  during his final episode when he reveals  that his father would make him listen to  the news  at a young age so he would never be  unaware of the atrocities in the world  he lives with the bad in the world but  he never forgets about it  tyrese dies while accompanying glenn  rick  michonne and noah on a trip to noah's  family home  unfortunately they find the place has  fallen and noah's family  is dead while there one of noah's  reanimated brothers emerges out of  nowhere and bites tyrese on the arm  noah goes for help and tyrese lays on  the floor bleeding  hallucinating both the people he saved  and the people he hurt  although the survivors are able to  amputate he's lost too much blood and  succumbs to his wounds  thankfully he accepts his fate before  the end reasoning out with his  hallucinations that death is no true  sadness for an empathetic person like  him  compared to the harsh world humanity now  lives in  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  the walking dead are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one
 

